{"id": "EUVD-2026-74835", "enisaUuid": "57ff3b3a-65fa-38a5-8d5c-295a694ddeab", "description": "Siyuan before v3.8.2 fails to apply publish-access filtering to embedded blocks before rendering in the /api/export/preview and /api/lute/copyStdMarkdown endpoints. Attackers with reader access can retrieve the full rendered content of private, hidden, or publish-disabled blocks by accessing public documents containing embed queries that select those blocks.", "datePublished": "2026-09-09T11:20:58", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-18T17:23:09", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/siyuan-note/siyuan/security/advisories/GHSA-8wx4-fvqw-f5f8", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/siyuan-before-3.8.2-information-disclosure-via-export-preview"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-87809", "GHSA-ghrq-8gf7-vmrq"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.35, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0bad52ab-e164-3b7a-b986-0c3c9f4a43dd", "product": {"name": "SiYuan", "vendor": {"name": "siyuan-note"}}, "product_version": "0 <3.8.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "fd091cd7-adfc-388e-87af-2df4916d06ff", "vendor": {"name": "siyuan-note"}}], "isExploited": false}